SUMMARY:mmtest benchmarking of cgroup code
LOCATION:Club A\, Prague Congress Centre
DESCRIPTION:Containers and checkpoint/restore MC · Michal Koutný · https
 ://lpc.events/event/20/contributions/2631/\n\nTriggered by:\na) various rs
 tat fixups as well as people reporting issues with (memory).stat reading v
 s writing performance & precision\nb) occasional reports/attempts to make 
 container startup quicker\n\nProblem statements:\na) cgroup rstats need to
  balance latency requirements of updaters (writers) and readers while pres
 erving sufficient precision. The improvement for one may cause some deteri
 oration at other places -- which is not always clear until those places st
 art being friction points.\nb) the cgroup creation path is on critical pat
 h of new container starts but there're no good insights into the behavior 
 of those.\n\nProposed solution:\nmmtests shellpack and monitor(s)\n\nAlter
 nate solutions:\n- selftest\, LTP tests\n- bpftrace probes\n- perf-bench
URL:https://lpc.events/event/20/contributions/2631/
END:VEVENT
